triforce-lv2: triforce-lv2 (LV2 microphone beamformer for Apple Silicon)
triforce-lv2:
triforce-lv2: An adaptive (MVDR) beamformer for the microphone array in Apple
triforce-lv2: Silicon laptops. Without it the array is too sensitive and too
triforce-lv2: omnidirectional to be useful.
triforce-lv2:
triforce-lv2: Used by asahi-audio's microphone filter chain on the MacBook Air
triforce-lv2: and MacBook Pro.
triforce-lv2: REQUIRED by asahi-audio for the laptop microphones.
triforce-lv2: Written by James Calligeros for the Asahi Linux project.
triforce-lv2: Homepage: https://github.com/chadmed/triforce
